    //   If M > x: contribution is 0.

    // So we need:
    //   count_less = number of (b2,...,bp) with sum=T and all bi <= x-1
    //   For M = x: we need to sum 1/(k+1) over all tuples with sum=T, max=x, and k players having value x.

